    {
      "id": "mara_help",
      "speaker": "Mara",
      "text": "I'm coming. I mend dockhands as often as cargo nets. Tell Ivo we'll help him. If either of you gets hurt, stay close to me.",
      "return_to": "mara_greeting"
    },
    {
      "id": "mara_theft",
      "speaker": "Mara",
      "text": "A crash from the office, then someone running across the court. I couldn't see who it was. Ivo went after them.",
      "return_to": "mara_greeting"
    },
    {
      "id": "mara_pay",
      "speaker": "Mara",
      "text": "I unload the boats and tend the tower lamp at night. The clerk pays us on Fridays. I was waiting for my wages when I heard the crash.",
      "return_to": "mara_greeting"
    },
    {
      "id": "mara_thanks",
      "speaker": "Mara",
      "text": "Thank you. Give me a moment to fill the reservoir. We should be able to see anyone else crossing the quay.",
      "return_to": "mara_greeting"
    },
    {
      "id": "mara_farewell",
      "speaker": "Mara",
      "text": "All right. Watch your footing by the water. Those boards are hard to see without the tower.",
      "return_to": "mara_greeting"
    },
    {
      "id": "mara_lamp",
      "speaker": "Mara",
      "text": "The reservoir ran dry. I was going to buy oil with tonight's pay. I should've fetched it before sunset.",
      "return_to": "mara_greeting"
    },
    {
      "id": "tide_gate",
      "speaker": "Mara",
      "text": "He ran east, towards the garden gate. It's the only way onto that terrace.",
      "return_to": "mara_greeting"
    },
    {
      "id": "ivo_gate",
      "speaker": "Ivo",
      "text": "The man in red ran from the office into the garden. I've shut the gate behind him. There's no other way out, but he's got two mechanical guards.",
